        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Ley Line Rupture"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(attack, evocation, force, occult)\n\nRequirements: The myroga is within 500 feet of a ley line\n\nThe myroga diverts some of the ley line's magic into a deadly and distant explosion. The myroga creates a detonation of force in a 5-foot square within a mile of its ley line and that it can see, dealing 5d6 force damage to creatures (DC 24 basic Reflex save). A myroga can will the detonation into existence anywhere within a mile of the ley line, possibly allowing it to ignore cover the target might have from, for example, an obstacle between itself and the myroga."
            },
